				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7a8117e elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-title elementor-page-title elementor-widget-heading" data-id="7a8117e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-title.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Amster, Rothstein &amp; Ebenstein, LLP once again named in IAM Patent 1000 The World’s Leading Patent Professionals for 2026</h1>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-51883db elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content" data-id="51883db" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-content.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					
<p><strong>IAM Patent 1000 – The World’s Leading Patent Professionals</strong></p>



<p>Amster, Rothstein &amp; Ebenstein LLP, is once again recognized in the 2026 IAM Patent 1000 for Patent Prosecution.</p>



<p>At the individual level, the ranking selected three of our Attorneys to feature in the upcoming 2026 Edition:</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li><a href="https://www.arelaw.com/team-members/gary-j-gershik/">Gary Gershik</a></li>



<li><a href="https://www.arelaw.com/team-members/douglas-a-miro/">Douglas Miro</a>&nbsp;</li>



<li><a href="https://www.arelaw.com/team-members/charles-r-macedo/">Charley Macedo</a></li>
</ul>



<p></p>



<p>Congratulations to all on earning standout accolades for their dedication, expertise, and leadership in the IP community as they continue to set a high standard. Well deserved!</p>



<p></p>
				</div>
				</div>
					</div>
				</div>
